            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
<h4>Requirements</h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>macOS 14 (Sonoma) or later</strong> — the app won't launch on older versions.</li>
<li><strong>Apple Silicon (M1 or newer)</strong> — recognition runs on the Neural Engine; Intel Macs are not supported.</li>
</ul>
<h4>Installation</h4>
<p>Drag <code>Grapheme.app</code> into Applications. The first launch downloads the recognition model (~630 MB) and walks you through three system permissions.</p>]]></description>
